<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines says to import 150,000 T U.S. corn.</title>
<headline>Philippines says to import 150,000 T U.S. corn.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines will import 150,000 tonnes of U.S. yellow corn for December delivery, officials of the state National Food Authority (NFA) said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
